# Canonical public base URL for the marketing site.
#
# v3 note: entry <head> tags no longer use Vite's %VITE_SITE_URL% replacement.
# Each page's index.html, public/sitemap.xml and public/robots.txt write the
# host out literally, so the built HTML cannot silently lose its canonical if
# the env var is missing on the build host. This value is kept as the single
# written record of the deploy host; keep it in step if the host ever changes.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://mercury-wealth-landing.vercel.app
